There was no automated PR to update the lock-files on Monday see https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/pulls?q=sort%3Aupdated-desc+is%3Apr+author%3Ascikit-learn-bot ...

[build log](https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/actions/runs/36380392222/job/108794783605) with the failure for the workflow updating the lock file.

Seems like a problem when creating the conda environment with conda-lock. First idea is to update our min conda-lock, looks like there have been a few releases since conda-lock 3.0.1 https://github.com/conda/conda-lock/releases. Second idea is to use `uv` and see if the same problem happens.

